WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.860
Same split. Different assistants.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:05.800
In RecoScope’s November 23 protein-powder
snapshot,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:09.140
Optimum Nutrition appeared in 10 of 12
answers.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.620
But first choice split two–two.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:15.520
ChatGPT and Gemini ranked Transparent Labs
first.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.960
Claude and Perplexity ranked Optimum
Nutrition first.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.860
November 17 also split two–two,

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.560
but Claude and Gemini were on opposite
sides.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.540
These are dated captures, not a controlled
trend.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:32.380
12 usable answers. Four AI assistants.
Three prompt types.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.300
Optimum Nutrition and Dymatize appeared in
all four under-$50 answers.

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.040
Mentions don’t verify checkout prices.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.560
For your brand, track the assistants
behind the totals.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.360
These findings don’t establish product
quality.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:49.300
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
